hip.\n\nThus maybe still B is best, but we need to discuss further. So we can state provisional recommendation remains B, but we need more info on decision quality, crew cooperation, responsibility, adaptability. Could ask a question to agent_2_tool or agent_3_tool for more info on B's decision quality or crew cooperation. But we can also just state our vote.\n\nGiven the instruction: \"From Round 2 onward, avoid starting a completely new point without connecting it to the prior discussion.\" So we should reference prior contributions: they both recommended B. We can say I agree with them, but highlight need to examine crew cooperation and decision quality. Provide evidence: B handles stress well, conscientious, but pretentious remarks. So we can say I still vote B.\n\nThus produce public message: agree with B, note strengths, note concerns, suggest need to probe further on decision quality and crew cooperation. Vote B.\n\nProceed."}
